WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A real hand is hidden; a rubber hand is visible.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Two brushes move in step.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Some participants report that the false hand feels like theirs.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Researchers compare matched and mismatched touch.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Sensory timing and expectation remain subjects of research.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
An experience is a question for evidence, not a product promise.
